<html><head><title>Merit System</title></head><body><h2><font color="#99FFOO">Karma</font></h2>This is the guild's merit system. It is a way that the officers can track players contribution to the guild. This will be used to determine who gets help on their epics, who gets loot on raids, etc. <br><br>Note these are subject to change as with any system it will take some getting used to. This system will only work if everyone reports their karma points. If you are on a raid make sure the officer on the raid takes down the names of all who attended. Also if you think someone deserves Karma points post them in the new Karma forum.<br><br><br>Raid attendance = 5 karma points <br>Porting a Raid = 10 karma points <br>Being the MA or Puller at a Raid = 20 karma points <br>Organizing/leading a raid = 30 karma points <br>Saving a raid = 50 karma points <br>Camping rare spawn mobs for guild = 5 karma points per hour <br>Helping a guildie with quests not on raid = 5 karma points <br>PLing a guildie per lvl = 5 karma points lvl 0-20, 10 karma points 20-40, 15 karma points lvl 50-60, 20 karma points lvl 60-65 <br><br>Karma levels <br><br>-15 = Cursed <br>-10 = Selfish <br>-5 = Sad <br>0 = Unknown <br>20 = Duteous <br> 40 = Agreeable <br>60 = Meritorious <br>90 = Heroic <br>120 = Pure <br>150 = Legendary <br><h2><font color="#99FFOO">Medals</font></h2>1. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_1.gif"> Service Cross - For rare acts of selflessness.<br><br>2. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_2.gif"> Medal of Honor <br><br>3. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_3.gif"> Silver Medallion of Sacrafice - Given out for those who chose to give their lives to further our cause.<br><br>4. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_4.gif"> Order of Valor <br><br>5. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_5.gif"> Recruitment Medal - Medal assigned for every 10 people above 55 recruited to the guild.<br><br>6. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_6.gif"> Order of Meritorious Service - For every year in the guild. <br><br>7. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_7.gif"> Star of Achievement - For outsanding achievement such as epics and titles. <br><br>8. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_10.gif"> Master Warrior's Medal - This is assigned to Melees who have mastered the art of being the MA/Puller. <br> <br>9. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_9.gif"> Bronze Order of Leadership - Guild Officers under lvl 60. <br><br>10. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_11.gif"> Silver Order of Leadership - Guild Officers over lvl 60.<br><br>11. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_12.gif"> Golden Order of Leadership - Guild Leader <br><br>12. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_13.gif"> Service Star - Service above and beyond normal duties of a guild member or officer.<br><br>13. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_16.gif"> Service Star Cluster - for several acts above and beyond the normal duties of a guild member or officer. <br><br>14. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_18.gif"> Crusaders Sword - For every five successful raids lead. <br><br>15. <img src="http://209.167.93.167/files/medals/medal_19.gif"> Defender's Order Cluster <br></body><html>  	</td></tr>	</table>        </td>        <td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=3><img src=http://209.167.93.167/files/misc_images/spacer.gif height=20 width=20></td></tr></table></center></html>